Cell["\<\
FOR  MAPLE : A set is an unordered sequence of distinct expressions enclosed \
in braces {}, representing a set in the mathematical sense.
A list is an ordered sequence of expressions enclosed in square brackets []. \
The ordering of the expressions is the ordering of es.
\
\>", "Text",
